WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.509 --> 00:00:02.260
IN AN EVENLY DIVIDED SENATE.

00:00:02.261 --> 00:00:03.359
CHRIS.

00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:05.746
&gt;&gt; Chris: DAVID, THANK YOU.

00:00:05.747 --> 00:00:09.316
AND JOINING US NOW, THE

00:00:09.317 --> 00:00:10.992
SECRETARY OF HOMELAND SECURITY,

00:00:10.993 --> 00:00:12.469
ALEJANDRO MAYORKAS.

00:00:12.471 --> 00:00:13.972
MR. SECRETARY, WELCOME TO

00:00:14.006 --> 00:00:14.717
"FOX NEWS SUNDAY"."

00:00:14.752 --> 00:00:15.531
&gt;&gt; Secretary Mayorkas: GOOD

00:00:15.532 --> 00:00:17.948
MORNING AND THANK YOU FOR HAVING

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:19.041
ME, CHRIS.

00:00:19.042 --> 00:00:22.147
&gt;&gt; Chris: I WANT TO START WITH

00:00:22.148 --> 00:00:23.687
SOMETHING THE WHITE HOUSE PRESS

00:00:23.688 --> 00:00:24.660
SECRETARY JEN PSAKI SAID THIS

00:00:24.662 --> 00:00:26.016
WEEK.

00:00:26.018 --> 00:00:28.052
TAKE A LOOK, SIR.

00:00:28.087 --> 00:00:30.160
&gt;&gt; WE ARE TAKING STEPS TO ENSURE

00:00:30.162 --> 00:00:31.321
THAT WHEN KIDS COME TO THE

00:00:31.356 --> 00:00:32.551
BORDER, WE LOOK TO SEE IF THEY

00:00:32.586 --> 00:00:34.763
HAVE A PHONE NUMBER IN MY POCKET

00:00:34.764 --> 00:00:36.308
SO WE CAN CALL THE FAMILY MEMBER

00:00:36.309 --> 00:00:38.872
AND GET THEM TO THEIR FAMILY

00:00:38.906 --> 00:00:40.659
MEMBERS AS QUICKLY AS POSSIBLE.

00:00:40.694 --> 00:00:42.137
&gt;&gt; Chris: I UNDERSTAND

00:00:42.139 --> 00:00:42.998
COMPASSION FOR THESE CHILDREN,

00:00:43.032 --> 00:00:45.708
BUT WHY IS IT THE RESPONSIBILITY

00:00:45.710 --> 00:00:48.681
OF THE U.S. TO RESETTLE MINORS

00:00:48.715 --> 00:00:52.212
COMING ACROSS THE BORDER

00:00:52.246 --> 00:00:52.681
ILLEGALLY?

00:00:52.682 --> 00:00:54.285
&gt;&gt; Secretary Mayorkas: CHRIS,

00:00:54.286 --> 00:00:55.655
THAT IS THE LAW UNDER THE

00:00:55.690 --> 00:00:57.337
UNITED STATES.

00:00:57.371 --> 00:00:59.922
WE HAVE AN ASYLUM PROGRAM THAT

00:00:59.924 --> 00:01:01.282
RECOGNIZES YOUNG CHILDREN,

00:01:01.283 --> 00:01:03.124
YOUNG, VULNERABLE CHILDREN’S

00:01:03.125 --> 00:01:05.978
RIGHT TO CLAIM ASYLUM, TO CLAIM

00:01:05.979 --> 00:01:08.706
FEAR FROM PERSECUTION BY REASON

00:01:08.707 --> 00:01:10.366
OF THEIR MEMBERSHIP IN A

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:11.475
PARTICULAR GROUP.

00:01:11.510 --> 00:01:13.343
THAT IS WHAT THE LAW PROVIDES

00:01:13.344 --> 00:01:16.955
AND WE ADMINISTER AND ENFORCE

00:01:16.957 --> 00:01:18.166
THOSE LAWS.

00:01:18.167 --> 00:01:20.978
&gt;&gt; Chris: YOU IN THE

00:01:21.012 --> 00:01:22.200
ADMINISTRATION TALK ABOUT BEING

00:01:22.201 --> 00:01:24.880
HUMANE, BUT LET’S GO BACK TO

00:01:24.881 --> 00:01:27.451
WHAT THE TRUMP POLICY WAS, WHICH

00:01:27.452 --> 00:01:29.539
IN THE CASE OF NONMEXICAN

00:01:29.573 --> 00:01:31.294
MINORS, WAS NOT, AS HAS BEEN

00:01:31.329 --> 00:01:32.586
SUGGESTION, SIMPLY TO TURN THESE

00:01:32.620 --> 00:01:34.337
KIDS ALONE DON’T MAKE AROUND AND

00:01:34.338 --> 00:01:35.777
PUT THEM BACK INTO THE DESERT.

00:01:35.778 --> 00:01:37.641
IN FACT WE WOULD COORDINATE WITH

00:01:37.676 --> 00:01:40.012
OTHER COUNTRIES, WE WERE CHARTER

00:01:40.013 --> 00:01:42.548
PLANES, WE WOULD SEND THEM BACK

00:01:42.582 --> 00:01:44.184
BY AIRPLANE TO RESETTLE WITH

00:01:44.186 --> 00:01:45.384
THEIR FAMILIES.

00:01:45.418 --> 00:01:47.782
WHY IS IT MORE HUMANE TO TAKE

00:01:47.816 --> 00:01:50.212
THESE KIDS, TO PUT THEM IN

00:01:50.213 --> 00:01:52.437
BORDER PATROL FACILITIES THAT

00:01:52.471 --> 00:01:54.007
WERE NOT MEANT FOR CHILDREN,

00:01:54.008 --> 00:01:57.391
OFTEN TIMES FOR MANY MORE DAYS

00:01:57.425 --> 00:01:59.088
THAN THE LEGAL LIMIT?

00:01:59.090 --> 00:01:59.969
&gt;&gt; Secretary Mayorkas: CHRIS,

00:02:00.003 --> 00:02:01.243
THAT IS NOT WHAT THE PRIOR

00:02:01.244 --> 00:02:03.538
ADMINISTRATION DID.

00:02:03.539 --> 00:02:05.772
YOU’LL FORGIVE ME.

00:02:05.773 --> 00:02:08.290
THE PRIOR ADMINISTRATION DID

00:02:08.291 --> 00:02:10.233
EXPEL CHILDREN, DID FLY CHILDREN

00:02:10.267 --> 00:02:13.318
TO COUNTRIES WHERE -- FROM WHICH

00:02:13.319 --> 00:02:15.277
THEY WERE FLEEING, COUNTRIES

00:02:15.311 --> 00:02:17.974
THAT DID NOT HAVE THE CAPACITY

00:02:17.975 --> 00:02:21.176
TO ADMINISTER ASYLUM CLAIMS,

00:02:21.177 --> 00:02:24.257
COUNTRIES THAT SUFFER TREMENDOUS

00:02:24.292 --> 00:02:26.777
VIOLENCE, POVERTY, CORRUPTION,

00:02:26.779 --> 00:02:29.426
AND OTHER INFIRMITIES, SO TO

00:02:29.427 --> 00:02:31.978
SUGGEST THAT THE PRIOR

00:02:31.979 --> 00:02:33.050
ADMINISTRATION HANDLED THE NEEDS

00:02:33.051 --> 00:02:37.170
OF CHILDREN IN A HUMANE WAY IS

00:02:37.171 --> 00:02:37.899
JUST FALSE.

00:02:37.901 --> 00:02:39.874
&gt;&gt; Chris: WELL, YOU SEEM TO

00:02:39.876 --> 00:02:41.400
HAVE AGREED WITH ME, SIR, THAT

00:02:41.401 --> 00:02:42.518
THEY WOULD PUT THEM ON PLANES.

00:02:42.552 --> 00:02:44.111
THEY WOULDN’T JUST SEND THEM

00:02:44.145 --> 00:02:45.845
BACK OVER THE DESERT, THEY WOULD

00:02:45.879 --> 00:02:48.967
PUT THEM ON A PLANE AND FLY THEM

00:02:49.002 --> 00:02:50.347
BACK TO GUATEMALA OR EL SALVADOR

00:02:50.348 --> 00:02:51.159
EL SALVADOR.

00:02:51.160 --> 00:02:52.436
ARE YOU SUGGESTING THAT EVERY

00:02:52.437 --> 00:02:53.345
MINOR -- THE THOUSANDS AND

00:02:53.346 --> 00:02:55.026
THOUSANDS OF MINORS COMING

00:02:55.027 --> 00:02:57.206
ACROSS THIS COUNTRY HAS A

00:02:57.241 --> 00:02:58.524
LEGITIMATE ASYLUM CLAIM AND THAT

00:02:58.559 --> 00:03:00.787
A LOT OF THEM ARE JUST COMING

00:03:00.788 --> 00:03:02.570
ACROSS THE BORDER BECAUSE THEY

00:03:02.571 --> 00:03:04.760
WANT TO HAVE A BETTER LIFE HERE

00:03:04.762 --> 00:03:05.677
IN AMERICA WHICH IS

00:03:05.678 --> 00:03:07.174
UNDERSTANDABLE, BUT ISN’T

00:03:07.175 --> 00:03:09.051
NECESSARILY OUR RESPONSIBILITY.

00:03:09.086 --> 00:03:10.465
&gt;&gt; Secretary Mayorkas: CHRIS,

00:03:10.466 --> 00:03:12.603
WE ADMINISTER OUR LAWS AND LET

00:03:12.605 --> 00:03:15.852
ME SAY A FEW THINGS, IF I MAY.

00:03:15.887 --> 00:03:16.986
NUMBER ONE, THE PRIOR

00:03:16.987 --> 00:03:17.993
ADMINISTRATION DISMANTLED THE

00:03:18.027 --> 00:03:20.518
ORDERLY AND SAFE WAY THAT THESE

00:03:20.552 --> 00:03:21.811
CHILDREN COULD MAKE THEIR CLAIMS

00:03:21.812 --> 00:03:22.018
CLAIMS.

00:03:22.019 --> 00:03:24.391
IT TORE DOWN THE CENTRAL

00:03:24.392 --> 00:03:25.393
AMERICAN MINORS PROGRAM THAT

00:03:25.428 --> 00:03:27.182
ALLOWED THESE CHILDREN TO MAKE

00:03:27.216 --> 00:03:29.096
THEIR CLAIMS UNDER UNITED STATES

00:03:29.131 --> 00:03:30.510
LAW WITHOUT HAVING TO TAKE THE

00:03:30.511 --> 00:03:31.563
PERILOUS JOURNEY.

00:03:31.598 --> 00:03:34.900
WE ARE REBUILDING THAT PROCESS.

00:03:34.901 --> 00:03:37.921
WE ARE ENCOURAGING FAMILIES NOT

00:03:37.956 --> 00:03:40.097
TO SEND THEIR CHILDREN ALONG THE

00:03:40.131 --> 00:03:41.789
DANGEROUS JOURNEY, BECAUSE SO

00:03:41.824 --> 00:03:44.058
MANY DO NOT MAKE IT SAFELY.

00:03:44.093 --> 00:03:45.351
WE ARE ENCOURAGING THEM NOT TO

00:03:45.352 --> 00:03:46.716
DO SO.

00:03:46.717 --> 00:03:48.646
YET IF THEY ARRIVE AT THE

00:03:48.681 --> 00:03:50.618
BORDER, WE HAVE A RESPONSIBILITY

00:03:50.652 --> 00:03:52.640
TO ALLOW THEM TO MAKE THEIR

00:03:52.641 --> 00:03:55.785
CLAIMS UNDER UNITED STATES LAW

00:03:55.786 --> 00:03:57.793
AND TO ADDRESS -- THESE ARE

00:03:57.827 --> 00:03:58.830
VULNERABLE CHILDREN -- TO

00:03:58.865 --> 00:04:00.809
ADDRESS THEIR NEEDS, AND WE CAN

00:04:00.810 --> 00:04:02.179
DO SO IN A SAFE AND ORDERLY

00:04:02.181 --> 00:04:02.479
MANNER.

00:04:02.514 --> 00:04:04.667
IT TAKES TIME BECAUSE THE ENTIRE

00:04:04.701 --> 00:04:06.050
SYSTEM WAS DISMANTLED.

00:04:06.051 --> 00:04:08.911
WE ARE WORKING ON IT AND WE WILL

00:04:08.913 --> 00:04:11.196
SUCCEED BECAUSE THAT IS WHAT WE

00:04:11.197 --> 00:04:11.436
DO.

00:04:11.437 --> 00:04:13.716
&gt;&gt; Chris: I’M GOING TO GET

00:04:13.718 --> 00:04:15.344
BACK TO THAT IN A MOMENT,

00:04:15.345 --> 00:04:18.038
MR. SECRETARY, BUT THE DAY AFTER

00:04:18.039 --> 00:04:19.654
PRESIDENT BIDEN TOOK OFFICE, HE

00:04:19.655 --> 00:04:22.417
MADE THIS PROMISE TO THE

00:04:22.419 --> 00:04:24.110
AMERICAN PEOPLE, TAKE A LOOK.

00:04:24.144 --> 00:04:24.924
&gt;&gt; President Biden: THE

00:04:24.958 --> 00:04:26.332
VICE PRESIDENT HARRIS AND I AND

00:04:26.367 --> 00:04:27.093
OUR ENTIRE ADMINISTRATION WILL

00:04:27.128 --> 00:04:28.717
ALWAYS BE HONEST AND TRANSPARENT

00:04:28.719 --> 00:04:32.550
WITH YOU ABOUT BOTH THE GOOD

00:04:32.552 --> 00:04:34.037
NEWS THE BAD.

00:04:34.072 --> 00:04:36.896
&gt;&gt; Chris: SO WHY HAS THE BIDEN

00:04:36.897 --> 00:04:38.179
ADMINISTRATION REFUSED TO ALLOW

00:04:38.214 --> 00:04:40.738
REPORTERS TO SEE FOR THEMSELVES

00:04:40.772 --> 00:04:42.414
AND TO RECORD WHAT THE

00:04:42.448 --> 00:04:44.991
CONDITIONS ARE UNDER WHICH THESE

00:04:45.025 --> 00:04:46.092
MINORS ARE BEING HOUSED?

00:04:46.127 --> 00:04:48.692
WHY IN FACT DID YOU, WHEN YOU

00:04:48.693 --> 00:04:51.469
WENT TO THE BORDER ON FRIDAY,

00:04:51.470 --> 00:04:52.724
AND LED A CONGRESSIONAL

00:04:52.758 --> 00:04:54.520
DELEGATION, WHY DID YOU REFUSE

00:04:54.554 --> 00:04:55.862
TO ALLOW REPORTERS TO SEE THE

00:04:55.863 --> 00:04:58.433
CONDITIONS UNDER WHICH THESE

00:04:58.467 --> 00:05:00.458
MINORS ARE BEING HELD?

00:05:00.492 --> 00:05:02.121
&gt;&gt; Secretary Mayorkas: TWO

00:05:02.122 --> 00:05:03.311
THINGS, CHRIS, IF I MAY.

00:05:03.312 --> 00:05:04.921
NUMBER ONE, LET’S NOT FORGET

00:05:04.922 --> 00:05:09.012
THAT WE ARE IN THE MIDST OF A

00:05:09.013 --> 00:05:11.656
PANDEMIC AND WE ARE FOCUSED ON

00:05:11.690 --> 00:05:13.334
OUR OPERATIONS EXECUTING OUR

00:05:13.369 --> 00:05:16.476
OPERATIONS IN A CROWDED BORDER

00:05:16.478 --> 00:05:19.664
PATROL FACILITY WHERE HUNDREDS

00:05:19.665 --> 00:05:21.115
OF VULNERABLE MIGRANT CHILDREN

00:05:21.150 --> 00:05:22.531
ARE LOCATED, NUMBER ONE.

00:05:22.565 --> 00:05:23.832
AND NUMBER TWO, WE’RE WORKING ON

00:05:23.833 --> 00:05:25.897
PROVIDING FOOTAGE SO THAT THE

00:05:25.898 --> 00:05:28.187
AMERICAN PUBLIC CAN SEE THE

00:05:28.188 --> 00:05:30.307
BORDER PATROL STATIONS AND I

00:05:30.308 --> 00:05:33.016
WOULD ENCOURAGE YOU AND OTHER

00:05:33.017 --> 00:05:34.288
REPORTERS TO SEE THE FACILITIES

00:05:34.322 --> 00:05:36.452
UNDER THE CONTROL OF THE HEALTH

00:05:36.453 --> 00:05:37.956
AND HUMAN SERVICES DEPARTMENT,

00:05:37.990 --> 00:05:39.643
WHERE THOSE CHILDREN ARE

00:05:39.644 --> 00:05:41.370
SHELTERED AND WHERE THEY BELONG

00:05:41.371 --> 00:05:44.426
AND WHERE WE ARE MOVING THEM AS

00:05:44.427 --> 00:05:47.922
QUICKLY AS POSSIBLE.

00:05:47.923 --> 00:05:49.796
&gt;&gt; Chris: SECRETARY MAYORKAS,

00:05:49.829 --> 00:05:51.583
RESPECTFULLY, SIR, I THINK THERE

00:05:51.617 --> 00:05:54.656
IS A SAFE CONDITION UNDER WHICH

00:05:54.690 --> 00:05:56.169
A POOL CAMERA CREW AND A

00:05:56.204 --> 00:05:57.452
REPORTER COULD GO INTO SOME OF

00:05:57.453 --> 00:05:58.174
THESE FACILITIES.

00:05:58.209 --> 00:05:59.959
THIS HAS BEEN GOING ON FOR TWO

00:05:59.960 --> 00:06:00.939
MONTHS NOW AND REPORT THE

00:06:00.973 --> 00:06:02.473
CONDITIONS UNDER WHICH THESE

00:06:02.475 --> 00:06:03.817
MINORS ARE BEING HELD, IT SEEMS

00:06:03.818 --> 00:06:05.967
TO ME TO SAY IT’S IMPOSSIBLE TO

00:06:06.002 --> 00:06:08.686
DO BECAUSE OF COVID SOUNDS LIKE

00:06:08.720 --> 00:06:09.613
AN EXCUSE.

00:06:09.614 --> 00:06:11.251
&gt;&gt; Secretary Mayorkas: CHRIS,

00:06:11.252 --> 00:06:12.879
WE ARE WORKING ON PROVIDING

00:06:12.914 --> 00:06:15.505
ACCESS SO THAT INDIVIDUALS WILL

00:06:15.539 --> 00:06:17.145
BE ABLE TO SEE WHAT THE

00:06:17.146 --> 00:06:19.048
CONDITIONS IN A BORDER PATROL

00:06:19.083 --> 00:06:20.070
STATION ARE LIKE, BUT FIRST

00:06:20.105 --> 00:06:22.982
THINGS FIRST, WE ARE IN THE

00:06:22.983 --> 00:06:24.711
MIDST OF A PANDEMIC WE ARE

00:06:24.713 --> 00:06:25.496
FOCUSED ON OPERATIONS AND

00:06:25.498 --> 00:06:26.731
EXECUTING ON OUR PLANS.

00:06:26.765 --> 00:06:28.839
THAT’S OUR HIGHEST PRIORITY, BUT

00:06:28.873 --> 00:06:32.476
WE ARE PROVIDING MORE ABOUT

00:06:32.510 --> 00:06:33.745
ACCESS AND CERTAINLY REPORTERS

00:06:33.780 --> 00:06:36.359
CAN SEE THE DEPARTMENT OF HEALTH

00:06:36.360 --> 00:06:37.720
AND HUMAN SERVICES FACILITIES IN

00:06:37.722 --> 00:06:40.065
WHICH CHILDREN ARE SHELTERED FOR

00:06:40.066 --> 00:06:42.558
A LONGER PERIOD OF TIME.

00:06:42.560 --> 00:06:43.694
&gt;&gt; Chris: TEXAS

00:06:43.696 --> 00:06:47.135
GOVERNOR GREG ABBOTT RAISED TWO

00:06:47.137 --> 00:06:48.606
CONCERNS THIS WEEK ABOUT

00:06:48.641 --> 00:06:49.825
CONDITIONS IN THE CAMP FOR

00:06:49.860 --> 00:06:52.431
MINORS IN MIDLAND, TEXAS.

00:06:52.432 --> 00:06:54.629
TAKE A LOOK, SIR.

00:06:54.631 --> 00:06:56.537
&gt;&gt; SO THERE IS NO BIBLE USABLE

00:06:56.538 --> 00:06:58.052
RUNNING WATER AT THE LOCATION IN

00:06:58.086 --> 00:07:00.990
MIDLAND AND THEN ON TOP OF THAT,

00:07:00.991 --> 00:07:03.400
MORE THAN 10% OF THE MIGRANTS AT

00:07:03.401 --> 00:07:06.470
THE MIDLAND LOCATION HAVE NOW

00:07:06.504 --> 00:07:08.265
TESTED POSITIVE FOR COVID-19.

00:07:08.266 --> 00:07:09.605
&gt;&gt; Chris: MR. SECRETARY, WHY

00:07:09.640 --> 00:07:10.816
NOT LET REPORTERS GO TO SEE WITH

00:07:10.850 --> 00:07:12.505
THE CONDITIONS ARE AT THE CAMP

00:07:12.506 --> 00:07:15.139
IN MIDLAND, AND IS IT TRUE THAT

00:07:15.173 --> 00:07:17.770
MORE THAN 10% OF THE MINORS IN

00:07:17.804 --> 00:07:20.463
MIDLAND HAVE TESTED POSITIVE AND

00:07:20.497 --> 00:07:23.101
IN FACT THAT MORE THAN 200

00:07:23.102 --> 00:07:24.238
MIGRANTS IN BROWNSVILLE TESTED

00:07:24.272 --> 00:07:27.422
POSITIVE FOR COVERT AND THEN

00:07:27.423 --> 00:07:29.088
WERE RELEASED?

00:07:29.089 --> 00:07:32.099
&gt;&gt; Secretary Mayorkas: CHRIS,

00:07:32.101 --> 00:07:34.161
THE MINORS WHO ARE ARRIVING AND

00:07:34.162 --> 00:07:35.383
WHO ARE PLACED IN THE DEPARTMENT

00:07:35.385 --> 00:07:37.102
OF HEALTH AND HUMAN SERVICES

00:07:37.103 --> 00:07:42.020
FACILITIES ARE TESTED, THEY ARE

00:07:42.055 --> 00:07:44.819
ALL TESTED, ISOLATED, AND

00:07:44.853 --> 00:07:45.515
QUARANTINE.

00:07:45.516 --> 00:07:47.222
OUR COVID-19 PROTOCOLS THAT ARE

00:07:47.223 --> 00:07:48.913
ADMINISTERED BY THE DEPARTMENT

00:07:48.948 --> 00:07:50.669
OF HEALTH AND HUMAN SERVICES ARE

00:07:50.670 --> 00:07:52.566
OPERATED VERY EFFICIENTLY.

00:07:52.600 --> 00:07:55.401
WE ALSO, I SHOULD SAY, WORK VERY

00:07:55.435 --> 00:07:59.413
CLOSELY WITH LOCAL OFFICIALS IN

00:07:59.415 --> 00:08:01.346
TEXAS, WITH LOCAL ORGANIZATIONS

00:08:01.380 --> 00:08:04.415
TO ALSO TEST, ISOLATE, AND

00:08:04.416 --> 00:08:07.321
QUARANTINE CHILDREN.

00:08:07.322 --> 00:08:09.229
AND WE OFFER REIMBURSEMENT,

00:08:09.264 --> 00:08:13.146
100%, FROM FEMA AND I DO HOPE

00:08:13.180 --> 00:08:14.977
THAT GOVERNOR ABBOTT RECONSIDERS

00:08:14.978 --> 00:08:18.067
HIS POSITION OF NOT ALLOWING

00:08:18.068 --> 00:08:20.376
THOSE LOCAL ORGANIZATIONS AND

00:08:20.410 --> 00:08:22.441
LOCAL OFFICIALS TO BE REIMBURSED

00:08:22.476 --> 00:08:24.024
100% BY THE FEDERAL GOVERNMENT.

00:08:24.026 --> 00:08:28.154
THAT’S ALL IN THE SERVICE OF THE

00:08:28.189 --> 00:08:30.235
PUBLIC HEALTH IMPERATIVE.

00:08:30.270 --> 00:08:32.505
&gt;&gt; Chris: EXCUSE ME, SIR, I

00:08:32.539 --> 00:08:34.226
WANT TO PUT UP WHAT

00:08:34.260 --> 00:08:36.701
PRESIDENT BIDEN HAS DONE ON

00:08:36.702 --> 00:08:38.716
IMMIGRATION POLICY IN JUST HIS

00:08:38.717 --> 00:08:40.251
FIRST TWO MONTHS IN OFFICE.

00:08:40.252 --> 00:08:42.903
HE HALTED PART OF TITLE 42 TO

00:08:42.905 --> 00:08:45.210
ALLOW UNACCOMPANIED MINORS TO

00:08:45.244 --> 00:08:47.168
STAY IN THE U.S. DURING THE

00:08:47.203 --> 00:08:47.982
PANDEMIC.

00:08:47.984 --> 00:08:49.877
HE ENDED THE PROVISION THAT

00:08:49.878 --> 00:08:51.337
ASYLUM-SEEKERS MUST REMAIN IN

00:08:51.371 --> 00:08:52.546
MEXICO WHILE THEIR CASES ARE

00:08:52.547 --> 00:08:54.447
BEING HEARD AND HE SUSPENDED THE

00:08:54.482 --> 00:08:57.382
SAFE THIRD COUNTRY AGREEMENTS TO

00:08:57.383 --> 00:08:58.707
SHARE ASYLUM-SEEKERS WITH OTHERS

00:08:58.741 --> 00:08:59.219
COUNTRIES.

00:08:59.254 --> 00:09:01.518
IT YOU PUT OUT THIS STATEMENT ON

00:09:01.519 --> 00:09:01.808
TUESDAY.

00:09:01.809 --> 00:09:04.464
"WE ARE ON PACE TO ENCOUNTER

00:09:04.465 --> 00:09:07.206
MORE INDIVIDUALS ON THE

00:09:07.241 --> 00:09:09.167
SOUTHWEST BORDER THEN WE HAVE IN

00:09:09.201 --> 00:09:10.475
THE LAST 20 YEARS."

00:09:10.476 --> 00:09:13.582
MR. SECRETARY, DO YOU NOT SEE A

00:09:13.584 --> 00:09:16.195
CONNECTION BETWEEN THE SURGE AT

00:09:16.196 --> 00:09:17.691
THE BORDER IN THE POLICY CHANGES

00:09:17.692 --> 00:09:20.745
THAT JOE BIDEN HAS MADE IN HIS

